### 1. Register User (Screenshot 1 Part A - 201)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nida Fatima",
  "email": "nida@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Login User (Screenshot 1 Part B - 200)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nida@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Create Category (Screenshot 2 - 201)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Programming"
}

### 4. Get All Categories (Screenshot 3 - 200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 5. Create Category - Missing Name (Screenshot 4 - 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": ""
}

### 6. Invalid Category ID (Screenshot 5 - 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories/99999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 7. Create Course (201)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "JavaScript Basics",
  "description": "Learn JavaScript from scratch",
  "category": "Programming",
  "price": 500,
  "instructor": "Nida Fatima"
}

### 8. Get All Courses (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Get Single Course by ID (200) - ID ko change karna
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses/REPLACE_WITH_REAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Unknown Route (Screenshot 5 Alt - 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/unknownroute
Content-Type: application/json